 Background->RGBColor[
  0.87, 0.94, 1],ExpressionUUID->"cbe0266b-f4a3-d940-82e6-f14506aefa32"],

Cell["\<\
1. Formaci\[OAcute]n de im\[AAcute]genes del cuerpo humano utilizando t\
\[EAcute]cnicas de medicina nuclear.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9530649721703463`*^9, 3.953064988003974*^9}, {
